**Input** (Naver 검색바 시그니처)
```css
.search { background: var(--bg-elevated); border: 2px solid var(--color-primary-500); border-radius: var(--radius-full); padding: 12px 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; box-shadow: 0 5px 18px rgba(3,199,90,0.10); }
